MODULE: TurnNotHeldAcrossDriveCallNeverServed
TARGET: TurnNotHeldAcrossDrive
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: a delivered foreground call never acknowledges completion
PERTURBS: CallServe

--- FIND
    /\ leaf' = [leaf EXCEPT ![l].call = "done"]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: a runtime service opportunity loses its acknowledgement.
    /\ leaf' = [leaf EXCEPT ![l].call = "queued"]
--- END
